WEBVTT

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:12.570
<b>I tried coming alone to our usual park.</b>

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.070
<b>It's a feeling I've never felt.</b>

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:21.660
<b>Like a child, frightened by the sound of the wind</b>

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:25.670
<b>I ran back along the path home.</b>

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:33.970
<b>The sky outside the window is too vast. Where are you now?</b>

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.130
<b>Please, may this reach you...</b>

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:44.690
<b>Dear Lord, if you ever grant wishes,</b>

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:50.110
<b>grant my wish right now, please!</b>

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:56.240
<b>I want to hear your voice, I miss you! I want to see you now!</b>

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.830
<b>Why must you already be looking toward tomorrow?</b>

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:06.210
<b>Don't just brush it off, saying the time has slipped by.</b>

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.540
<b>Once more...</b>

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:14.550
<b>I love you, and yet it's been too late since long ago.</b>

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:19.140
<b>Even if I give up, it can't be like the past.</b>

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:24.350
<b>Don't just decide so simply there's no way, no choice.</b>

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:28.230
<b>Smile once more.</b>

00:01:59.990 --> 00:02:01.140
Kogorr!

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:17.910
The mysterious plant-like creatures

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:23.660
that appeared at the White House have 
shown their monstrous true form!

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:43.580
<i>Washington has issued an 
emergency evacuation order.</i>

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:47.370
<i>And the well-being of the 
President and his staff</i>

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:51.980
<i>who were in the White House before it 
was swallowed up is currently unknown.</i>

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:57.000
<i>The Skrugg have reappeared, 
but I'm sure that Heroman...</i>

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:04.570
I mean, I'm sure that both 
of them will do something!

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:09.200
It's the brat...

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:12.500
You again?

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:14.710
That's my line!

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:22.950
You can try again, but 
it'll turn out the same!

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:26.980
We'll stop you... as many times as it takes!

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:29.530
Impossible.

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:32.710
You fools can no longer stop me.

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:40.190
Because this Earth is already well on 
its way towards being annihilated...

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:44.300
Heroman!

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:50.060
Will you attack?

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:56.510
Then I will make you realize just how 
much more powerful I am than that time!

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:03.710
We've entered the airspace 
of the bombing target!

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:05.530
Code entered.

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:06.570
Safeties disengaged.

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:10.670
Can we really win with this?

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.100
Keep it together.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.770
That kid's down there fighting 
his heart out, you know?

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:19.160
We will accomplish our mission.

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:23.630
Yeah...

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:27.490
Prepare to drop the storm gathering bombs!

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:36.040
Bombs away!

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:53.600
Hey, what's with that?

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:57.020
What's the point of bombing the sky?

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:58.430
Did you forget?

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:00.750
I told you, remember?

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:06.350
They're making the energy that we're 
going to use to recharge Heroman.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:09.370
That?

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:14.280
Those bombs have a special compound in them.

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:19.670
This compound makes all the water vapor in 
the air gather together almost explosively!

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:24.490
Pretty soon the entire sky will 
be covered with storm clouds.

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:29.180
Lightning?

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:31.800
Exactly!

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:36.940
We'll get those clouds to produce lightning, 
and have it strike Heroman directly!

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:46.100
If it works, he should be able to have plenty of 
energy to recover, just like the time he ran out.

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:49.870
But wait...

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:53.310
Is it possible to direct where 
lighting strikes like that?

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:55.950
I overlook NOTHING!

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:03.880
Generally speaking, lighting tries 
to avoid traveling through air.

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:08.660
That's why it zig-zags as it falls 
and strikes the tallest buildings.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:10.930
We'll make use of that tendency!

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:15.420
I've installed special equipment on the MR-1

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:20.520
that can create an artificial 
vacuum in the vicinity of Heroman.

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:24.300
If I do that, as it tries to avoid the air,

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:28.070
the lighting will strike toward the 
invisible vacuum that acts like a lightning rod,

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:32.670
and Heroman's charging up will be complete!

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:39.580
So that's why we've got to hurry and 
get this thing near Heroman, then?

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:42.830
Yes...

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.660
As soon as possible.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:57.070
You are such a fool.

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:02.350
Thinking you could oppose 
me, as weak as you are.

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:04.930
You're too late.

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:08.690
There is no one that can stop me now.

00:07:11.050 --> 00:07:12.720
If I make one false step, I'm done for.

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:17.790
That's...

00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:25.050
Those are... the spheres!

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:27.880
The spheres are heading toward Kogorr!

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:53.710
The spheres...

00:07:53.710 --> 00:07:57.920
The spheres are turning into a liquid, 
and being absorbed by Kogorr!

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:08.300
Mr. Hughes... What in the world is going on?

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:11.100
It's probably...

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:17.220
Well, our common wisdom is 
useless against the Skrugg.

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:22.460
The spheres melted?

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:26.480
Those spheres, that humanity 
couldn't even scratch?!

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:28.020
Just like that?

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:35.180
Watch where yer drivin', baldy!

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:42.330
Hey, Professor!

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:43.180
Look ahead!

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:43.870
Watch out!

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:45.930
Ahead?

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:01.810
Phew...

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:21.600
That was close...

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:34.820
What in the world...

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:37.140
I told you already.

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:40.140
I will devour this world.

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:44.710
Everything I consume will 
become my sustenance.

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:49.730
And they are no exception!

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:01.370
Lord Kogorr, what are you...

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:03.360
Hey, wait...

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:06.520
He's eating his ally?

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:17.800
Everything will become my food!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:39.390
This isn't good...

00:10:39.390 --> 00:10:40.750
Let's move a bit farther away!

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:41.760
We can't!

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:43.690
This is a crucial moment!

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:45.450
Is this the time to worry about that?

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:48.140
If we're shot down, that's it!

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:49.820
But...

00:10:50.890 --> 00:10:51.850
Don't worry.

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:55.080
We'll keep filming.

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:56.980
We should just get some altitude, and then...

00:10:58.600 --> 00:10:59.470
Understood!

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:01.680
Guess that's for the best!

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:15.880
At this rate...

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:20.620
That's...

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:27.100
Will!

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:40.260
Will!

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:54.820
Heroman!

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:48.660
Heroman...

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:54.600
Is everyone okay?

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:55.520
Yeah...

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:56.920
Somehow...

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:59.190
Thank goodness.

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:00.510
Don't be so relieved.

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:02.440
What're we supposed to do now?

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.220
We fell pretty far...

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:10.970
How are the preparations?

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:12.310
We can go any time.

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:13.900
Okay, head out.

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:14.440
Yes, sir.

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:19.980
Why are you heading to the scene now?

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:24.020
I can give orders more quickly observing 
the situation on the ground myself.

00:13:24.020 --> 00:13:26.070
I can't do that from the cargo plane.

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.250
Then why not use a helicopter?

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:30.830
The enemy has complete 
control of the airspace.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:34.960
There's a great chance that we'd 
be shot down if we got too close.

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:40.330
In the end, Mr. Denton's 
plan seemed to be the best.

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:46.000
I'm sorry about getting you involved 
in something this dangerous.

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:48.550
I-I don't really mind.

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:50.700
I know.

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:55.440
But they're fighting in an 
even more dangerous situation.

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:57.970
I couldn't just sit there doing nothing.

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:10.430
Will!

00:14:11.340 --> 00:14:12.860
Will, answer me!

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:22.110
Are you okay?

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:28.010
I didn't ask for your help.

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:33.070
Get away from here, Will.

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:34.190
We'll handle this.

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:35.140
Not a chance!

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:36.700
Will?

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:41.150
I have no reason to follow your orders.

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:42.780
I...

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:45.840
I came here for my own fight!

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:47.720
Will...

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:49.920
Don't misunderstand me!

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:52.250
I'm not your ally or anything!

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:53.990
But...

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:56.490
Even so, we have the same goal.

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:03.360
Ironic, isn't it?

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:07.550
This weapon caused Heroman so much 
trouble, and now it's going to help him?

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:11.680
Hate to say it, but we 
really owe Dr. Minami one.

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:13.480
That's the way!

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:15.350
Nice and slow!

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:16.140
Slowly!

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:22.640
Hurry! It's about to break!

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:23.550
No!

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:25.770
It'll be even more dangerous 
to pull up too quickly!

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:28.380
So take it slow!

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:29.510
But hurry!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.870
Make up your damn mind!

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:33.360
Hurry!

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:33.360
Slowly!

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:35.260
...says them.

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:37.100
Don't worry.

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:40.000
This speed will do, according 
to my calculations.

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:53.050
Professor!

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:56.360
Let's do this thing!

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:13.510
Excellent.

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:16.910
No, don't look at me.

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:20.410
That's just the amazing 
potential the MR-1 possesses.

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:24.920
With it, we're going to save 
Joey and Heroman, for sure!

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:35.630
Do you understand?

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:40.330
Our target is the crystal on Kogorr's chest!

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:43.470
I realized it after my body became like this.

00:16:43.470 --> 00:16:46.400
That's the weak point for all the Skrugg!

00:16:47.260 --> 00:16:50.020
If we can destroy that 
crystal, we can end it all!

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:52.150
Heroman.

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:55.450
Will.

00:16:58.760 --> 00:16:59.460
Let's go!

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:07.920
You bastards...

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.310
You're mine!

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:14.010
Look at that!

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:15.830
What's going on?

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:19.870
Go back! On the double!

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:21.640
Get the shot!

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:27.230
Somehow...

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:28.990
Somehow I have to get up there...

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:20.520
Then how about this?

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:39.100
Heroman!

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:03.410
What?!

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:14.400
You impudent little...

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:17.660
Take this!

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:23.970
That's not all!

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:31.570
Heroman!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.060
Go!

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:00.520
Fool.

00:20:00.520 --> 00:20:03.720
I've already predicted your every move!

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:05.110
Oh, I wonder about that.

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:13.100
Heroman...

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:15.650
Augment!

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:19.070
What?

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:35.250
Finish him, Joey!

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:38.100
Heroman...

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:40.250
Blast!

00:20:49.550 --> 00:20:50.970
I don't think so!

00:21:15.610 --> 00:21:16.470
All right!

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:23.720
Too bad.

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:29.800
That's not where my weak point is!

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:13.480
Heroman!!!

00:22:29.310 --> 00:22:32.400
<b>I want to get to know you better,</b>

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:35.490
<b>to go at each other with our true feelings.</b>

00:22:35.490 --> 00:22:41.830
<b>Your tears and smile are both here.</b>

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:46.260
<b>No matter how hard it is, I won't be scared any more.</b>

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:49.320
<b>With both of us, we can go anywhere.</b>

00:22:49.320 --> 00:22:54.760
<b>Since you're the one who taught me that I'm not alone.</b>

00:22:54.760 --> 00:23:02.450
<b>Every time I mutter the words "I was born to meet you"</b>

00:23:03.120 --> 00:23:07.490
<b>my unease disappears, and my heart burns stronger.</b>

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:14.440
<b>Thank you. We'll go on together with a sign only we understand.</b>

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:19.300
<b>Carve out this irreplaceable time!</b>

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:23.840
<b>I can't move away from here.</b>

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:28.060
<b>Because I live feeling the same heartbeat.</b>

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:30.280
<b>I want to protect you to the very last,</b>

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:32.680
<b>to protect the promise built up.</b>

00:23:33.460 --> 00:23:40.080
<b>Thank you. We'll go on together with a sign only we understand.</b>

00:23:40.300 --> 00:23:45.810
<b>We are carving out this irreplaceable time!</b>

00:23:50.930 --> 00:23:52.630
On the next Heroman:

00:23:52.630 --> 00:23:53.950
Heroman!

00:23:53.950 --> 00:23:54.920
It can't be!

00:23:54.920 --> 00:23:55.850
Answer me!

00:23:55.850 --> 00:23:57.290
Say something!

00:23:57.290 --> 00:23:58.910
I'm begging you!

00:23:58.910 --> 00:24:01.120
Kogorr continues to evolve 
to his complete form,

00:24:01.120 --> 00:24:03.290
and Heroman has fallen silent 
after being attacked.

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:09.230
While the countdown to Earth's destruction 
begins, Joey makes his decision.

00:24:09.230 --> 00:24:12.470
The final battle heads toward its climax.

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.000
Next time on Heroman #26: Faith.

00:24:16.420 --> 00:24:18.870
Heroman!
